{"unit_id":"hengyun721__dsh-finalize#card-zh","repo":"hengyun721/dsh-finalize","commit":"8b12fa067ddedd7d857f6120eaca59d5f48211e5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-finalize 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的文件交付检查插件，会在 present 或 qqbot_send_file 等配置的交付工具执行前处理文档。它可清理 DOCX、PPTX、XLSX 和 ODF 文件中的生成器痕迹、模板缩略图并重算可推导的统计信息；还会检查六种语言的标点，并把不能从文件证明的事项列入报告。PDF 只读取文本层并检查，不改写文件。交付报告可在消息操作区的面板查看，也能扫描最近的 Office 文件。适合需要在发送文档前整理文件并复核未解决项目的 DSH 用户；无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:229","index.js:234","lib/office.js:573","client.js:194"]}
{"unit_id":"hengyun721__dsh-finalize#card-en","repo":"hengyun721/dsh-finalize","commit":"8b12fa067ddedd7d857f6120eaca59d5f48211e5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-finalize checks files before DSH delivery. It cleans document metadata and recomputes available statistics in Office files, checks punctuation in six languages, and reports unresolved items. PDFs are read-only. Review results in the message panel or scan recent files.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:229","lib/office.js:573","client.js:194"]}
